Corrective fix: No action needed now. To prevent recurrence, review /var/log/frr/frr.log and service uptime on r11/r12, ensure FRR is enabled and not being restarted by cron, and monitor OSPF/EIGRP stability on B (r11.eth1) and EE (r11.eth0/r12.eth0). If flaps persist, investigate link stability or daemon restarts. 
